      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Established in 1970, North Seattle College is a public community college in the Northgate neighbourhood of Seattle, Washington. The College is a starting point for students who want to transfer to the highest-performing universities. It attracts around 14,000 students per year. The College offers many academic and career-oriented programs, including transfer degrees, professional and technical certificates, and workforce training. The small class sizes, staff support and focus on student success inspire students to achieve their educational goals.</p><p>Student success is a crucial focus for the College, reflected in its facilities. There are multiple study areas too. The library houses a wealth of information and resources.</p>",
