      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>North Seattle College does not provide on-campus accommodation. Students often choose to rent a nearby flat or house with friends or via finding suitable flatmates. The college website has a helpful resource page with links to various off-campus housing options, and the College has a roommate finder service for students seeking to share housing costs.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
